      "writtenOn": "2024-09-02T04:23:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Updated the doc to explain this string, and noted that caller needs to subscribe to the state. Returning the ephemeral key in this string means the ephemeral key mode is successfully activated, and can be used until it gets deactivated. Although caller can subscribe to get the key, returning the key in OutcomeReceiver makes the OutcomeReceiver more complete. Thoughts?",
